Package: com.example.autodarkicon
Name: Auto Dark Icon for LiveContainer
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Makes LiveContainer guest app icons follow the system appearance automatically: dark icons in dark mode, light icons in light mode, instead of the manual darkModeIcon switch.
